<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάμνη-σις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναμιμνῄσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>calling
				to mind, reminiscence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				72e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				92d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				34c
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				451a21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινος λαβεῖν</span>
			<i>recall</i> it <i>to memory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				2.628.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναμνήσεις θυσιῶν</span>
			<i>reminders to the gods</i> of sacrifices offered, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>memorial sacrifice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				10.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				22.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίνδρομος ἀ.,</span> of the moon, <i><span class="en">
				Secund.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				6
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
